- takes `a b : Fin (n+1) → ℝ`, `hle : a ≤ b`, vector field `f : ℝⁿ⁺¹ → Eⁿ⁺¹`, derivative `f'`, and gives `∫ x in Icc a b, ∑ i, f' x (e i) i = ∑ faces...`.

